UsageMesh v2.6.0 — local workspace

- Ship a self-contained local Web interface with `usagemesh serve`.
- Add observed quota windows, project/session accounting and configurable native reminders.
- Manage Codex and Claude provider configurations with redacted previews, backups and guarded rollback.
- Inspect channel quality from separately labeled probes and imported events.
- Connect read-only CLIProxyAPI and OpenAI-compatible model catalogs.
- Keep local configuration and secrets outside the encrypted GitHub dashboard protocol.
